the way that she respects you.

902
01:14:50,550 --> 01:14:52,745
I'm not saying that I was right, okay?

903
01:14:54,070 --> 01:14:55,549
And I'm sorry.

904
01:14:59,990 --> 01:15:01,218
You're sorry?

905
